REASONING: To find the intersection, we set the parameterized equations of the plane and line equal to each other and solve for the parameters.
ANSWER: \begin{pmatrix} 1+2t+2s \\ 6-t-3s \\ 7-t-5s \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7+3u \\ 4 \\ 1-u \end{pmatrix}
\begin{cases} 1+2t+2s=7+3u \\ 6-t-3s=4 \\ 7-t-5s=1-u \end{cases}
